From 38107caffa40011d4700e7559a4aeee20613349f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 13:16:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Repair statistics, validation, export and guide-state
 defects of the 1.4.2 QA report

- statistical result contract (qemx/stats.py): protocol moments for learning methods, exact fit kept as reference
- readout inverse norm, singular/negative-determinant calibrations, PEC and NIL input validation
- FR id migration (features='nil' -> 'fr'), record schema /3 with mixed-schema guard
- budget preflight (insufficient_budget) and a budget-scaled NIL teaching preset
- bounded, subprocess-based image export; data never waits on rendering
- atomic guide setups with replace/merge; saved custom recipes never deleted
- tests/test_qa_v15.py

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MXEKrsCo9uyAPKEqvGJ4mi
